    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Nellie B. Connally Breast Center is named for a fierce breast cancer advocate and former First Lady of Texas. With Nellie in mind, we strive to treat each breast cancer patient with personalized attention, the best diagnosis and treatment options, and follow-up care to maximize your life after cancer."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "UT MD Anderson's"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "With locations across the Houston area, including the , , , and , has one of the largest breast cancer treatment programs in the world. This gives us a level of experience that is second to none. Our team of experts uses this knowledge to create highly specialized treatment plans for all types and stages of breast cancer."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Texas Medical Center",
     "href": "/about-md-anderson/our-locations/texas-medical-center.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "League City",
     "href": "/about-md-anderson/our-locations/league-city.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Sugar Land",
     "href": "/about-md-anderson/our-locations/sugar-land.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "West Houston",
     "href": "/about-md-anderson/our-locations/west-houston.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "The Woodlands",
     "href": "/about-md-anderson/our-locations/the-woodlands.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "UT MD Anderson"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "approach to breast cancer is more than just treatment. The Breast Center offers genetic testing and counseling for women with a family history of breast cancer. Your care team also includes skilled plastic surgeons that can make you look and feel normal again with the latest breast reconstruction procedures."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "UT MD Anderson's"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "More",
     "href": "#"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Less",
     "href": "#"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "Breast cancer surgery: 4 things to know"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 28,
